 "audit": "Same guide hub; Women's Tops chart (/en-gb/t/size-guide/womens-tops/), Centimetres toggle (inches in _in). Prints XS-XXL and 1X-3X with bust, waist and US sizes only. Old XS 'UK 8' 82/63/87 -> 78.7-83.8/58.4-63.5; M 89/71/95 -> 91.4-96.5/71.1-76.2; XXL 107/89/113 -> 111.8-116.8/91.4-96.5. 1X-3X added. UK/EU removed (not printed). Hips removed: the tops chart has none, and the Women's Bottoms chart's cm hip column contradicts its own inch column (XS 33-35 in vs 90.2-95.3 cm), so it wasn't used. Moresports source dropped (retailer)."
